{{!
    @template local_moodesk/search_box

    The Search Box — a prominent search field with its own submit.

    Distinct from the toolbar's filter input (layout/_filters.scss) on purpose:
    that one narrows a table the user is already looking at; this one IS the
    page's primary action — "type what is wrong". Introduced by the knowledge
    base landing, written for reuse: nothing here knows what is being searched.

    One <form role="search">, one text input with an accessible name, one
    submit button with a visible label. An optional hint renders under the
    field and is wired to it with aria-describedby, so it is read when focus
    returns to the field after a submit that could not search.

    Context variables:
      * action        - URL the form submits to (GET)
      * name          - Name of the query parameter
      * value         - Current query, or ""
      * label         - Accessible name of the field (not visible)
      * placeholder   - Hint inside the empty field
      * buttonlabel   - Visible label of the submit button
      * hint          - Optional text under the field, or absent
      * hintid        - Id for the hint element (required when hint is present)
      * hiddenfields  - Optional [{name, value}] carried through the submit

    Example context (json):
    {
      "action": "/local/moodesk/kb.php",
      "name": "q",
      "value": "password reset",
      "label": "Search the knowledge base",
      "placeholder": "Search the knowledge base…",
      "buttonlabel": "Search",
      "hint": "Type at least 3 characters to search.",
      "hintid": "mhd-search-hint",
      "hiddenfields": []
    }
}}
<form class="mhd-search-box" role="search" method="get" action="{{action}}">
  <div class="mhd-search-box__row">
    <svg class="mhd-search-box__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
         stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/>
      <path d="M20 20l-3.5-3.5"/>
    </svg>
    <input type="search" class="mhd-search-box__input" name="{{name}}" value="{{value}}"
           placeholder="{{placeholder}}" aria-label="{{label}}" autocomplete="off"
           {{#hint}}aria-describedby="{{hintid}}"{{/hint}}>
    {{#hiddenfields}}<input type="hidden" name="{{name}}" value="{{value}}">{{/hiddenfields}}
    <button type="submit" class="mhd-btn mhd-btn--filled">{{buttonlabel}}</button>
  </div>
  {{#hint}}
  <p class="mhd-search-box__hint" id="{{hintid}}">{{hint}}</p>
  {{/hint}}
</form>
